			<td style="vertical-align:top;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Includes 563,402 shares held by Mr. Griffin directly, 1,326,736 shares held by a Family Limited Partnership, 3,289 shares held by Mr. Griffin&#8217;s adult son, 1,289 shares held by Mr. Griffin&#8217;s adult daughter, 614,964.629 shares held in an irrevocable trust (previously held by his late father), and 300,000 shares held in a revocable trust owned by his mother. Mr. Griffin disclaims beneficial ownership interest in the shares held by the Family Limited Partnership, by his adult son, by his adult daughter, by the irrevocable trust and by the revocable trust, except to the extent of his pecuniary interest therein. Also included in Mr. Griffin&#8217;s total are 5,790 restricted stock units that vest in full on or before April 3, 2026. Mr. Griffin also has 5,780 restricted stock units that have not vested and are not included in this total.</p>
