<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Of the amount reported for Mr. Glazer, $125,023 relates to 8,346 restricted stock units Mr. Glazer received for service as the Company&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer and President. The additional $66,915 reported for Mr. Glazer relates to the 4,500 restricted stock units he received for his service as a director.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The amounts reported for Mr. Boehm reflect the value at grant date of the 35,000 shares of restricted stock and 32,830 restricted stock units granted on the commencement of his employment. All such awards were forfeited upon his resignation.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

