<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Column (f) </b>&#8211;<b> Option Awards</b></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The amount recorded in this column is the compensation cost granted by the Company during the fiscal year indicated in column (b) under ASC Topic 718, Stock Compensation.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Column (g) </b>&#8211;<b> Non-Equity Incentive Plan Compensation</b></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">See &#8220;CD&amp;A &#8211; Annual Cash Incentive Bonus&#8221; for a description of the Incentive Compensation Plan<i>.</i> Amounts shown for 2024 were paid to the named executive officers in February 2025. Amounts shown for 2025 were paid to the named executive officers in February 2026. Mr. Griffin elected to receive his 2024 and 2025 annual cash incentive bonus payments in stock in lieu of cash.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Column (h) - Change in Pension Value and Nonqualified Deferred Compensation Earnings</b></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">See &#8220;Nonqualified Deferred Compensation&#8221;.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Column (i) </b>&#8211;<b> All Other Compensation</b></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">All other compensation includes the following:</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

