			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The amounts set forth in this column equal the number of unvested restricted stock units multiplied by the closing market price of the underlying common stock ($13.49) on December 31, 2025.</p>
