<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">8 </sup>The amounts reported as &#8220;Compensation Actually Paid&#8221; in 2024 to Messrs. Glazer, Wawrin and Griffin have been calculated in accordance with Item 402(v) of SEC Regulation S-K. As required by Item 402(v), the following adjustments were made to each such individual&#8217;s 2024 total compensation in order to compute &#8220;compensation actually paid&#8221;:</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<div>
